RULE_VERSION: 1.0
RULE_NAME: MEDIA_CENTER
APP_TYPE: MEDIA
TARGET: PI_SOLOHOST
GOAL: A usable personal media center that can discover, select, and play media.

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES:
- Search
- Playback
- History
- Favorites
- Error handling
- SoloHost runtime compatibility

SECRETS:
YOUTUBE_API_KEY
EXECUTION:
  MAX_CYCLES: 10
  MAX_TASKS: 20
  MAX_RETRIES_PER_TASK: 1
  AUTO_APPLY: true
  VERIFY_EACH_TASK: true
  STOP_ON_USER_ACTION: true

DEFINITION_OF_DONE:
- Search returns usable media results
- Playback works
- History persists
- Favorites work
- Runtime errors are handled
- SoloHost runtime starts successfully
